T1  - Chapter 14 - AI-driven drug repurposing strategies for hepatocellular carcinoma: Unlocking new therapeutic potential
AU  - Manoharan, Suryaa
AU  - Santhakumar, Aksayakeerthana
AU  - Perumal, Ekambaram
A2  - Nagaraju, Ganji Purnachandra
A2  - Venkatesan, Amouda
